# Configure Git to always use LF line endings.
#
# '* text=auto eol=lf' tells Git to:
#   1. Automatically detect whether files are text or binary.
#   2. Store text files with LF line endings.
#   3. Get text files with LF line endings on all platforms.
#
# This helps:
#   - Ensure consistent line endings regardless of contributor platform.
#   - Prevent unnecessary line ending changes in diffs when collaborating across platforms.
#   - Avoid "false" changes that only involve line ending differences.

* text=auto eol=lf
